                "message": "✨ Write PDF page labels and read them to open chapters in a book's PDF\n\n- Add tools/pdf-labels-articles.py (batch, from the BibTeX pages field) and tools/pdf-labels-book.py (one book, by hand), both dry run by default with a backup before writing.\n- Add tools/pdf-labels-read.py; sp-devonthink asks it which PDF page has the chapter's first printed page.\n- Remove sp-devonthink-page-offset and sp-devonthink-parent-page-offsets.\n- Add ADR 0032 and the literate doc pdf-page-labels.org.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiBXqXW4Xbxy8r2aJtW",
